      "cat": "workflow",
      "tier": "functional",
      "w": 2,
      "h": 2,
      "animated": true,
      "blocks": true,
      "desc": "BAY — the agent dock. Click it, assign an agent — done: work for that agent lands here, no belts required. Add belts to watch work ride in from an INBOX (and finished work ride out to an OUTBOX). The props in its room become its powers.",
